cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper it accompanies, listed under
  preferred-citation below.
title: SusTRA evaluation code
abstract: >-
  Code reproducing the six use cases and seven figures of the SusTRA paper:
  direction alignment, min-max normalisation, Pareto dominance, empirical-front
  extraction, distance to the front, and classification of a change as a strict
  improvement, a trade-off improvement, burden shifting, or a degradation.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/lsinfo3/sustainet_assessment_framework
